+## 7.3 Closed formula and tree-gcd equality
+
+For an odd prime \(p\), (7.4) is nonzero precisely when exactly two degrees,
+say \(e_a,e_b\), are \(p\)-units and
+\(e_a\equiv e_b\pmod p\). In that case
